From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:14:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner hardware spinlock
 driver

The A733 device tree describes the hardware spinlock unit; without
CONFIG_HWSPINLOCK_SUN6I it has no driver. Build it as a module, nothing
needs it to boot.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the module loads and binds to the spinlock
unit.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 749326646d99..9ae084ec02d8 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1605,6 +1605,7 @@ CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_XLNX_CLKWZRD=m
 CONFIG_HWSPINLOCK=y
 CONFIG_HWSPINLOCK_OMAP=m
 CONFIG_HWSPINLOCK_QCOM=y
+CONFIG_HWSPINLOCK_SUN6I=m
 CONFIG_TEGRA186_TIMER=y
 CONFIG_CLKSRC_STM32_LP=y
 CONFIG_RENESAS_OSTM=y
